(7556705, 1210743, 182284, '<td valign="top">Actually this wasn''t the shot I was going for. I had the timer set on the camera by the time I shot this photo, Gracie was in the photo and my hands were freezing. I was blowing on my hands to warm them up. I did decide to use this one because it was definitely not posed. Thanks for all the titles and votes.</td>', 'Actually this wasn''t the shot I was going for. I had the timer set on the camera by the time I shot this photo, Gracie was in the photo and my hands were freezing. I was blowing on my hands to warm them up. I did decide to use this one because it was definitely not posed. Thanks for all the titles and votes.', '2018-01-31 00:05:58.000000', NULL, 0),
