(7557045, 1210709, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge brief well<br/> <br/>What a lot of positive comments, a deserving image. As you say, lots of lovely detail I bet it looks good on your print. It would probably have scored if, again as you say, it was more dynamic with prey in his beak too, as it is it is still a great image, well done Ronnie</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge brief well What a lot of positive comments, a deserving image. As you say, lots of lovely detail I bet it looks good on your print. It would probably have scored if, again as you say, it was more dynamic with prey in his beak too, as it is it is still a great image, well done Ronnie', '2018-02-02 09:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7557046, 1210226, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge brief well<br/> <br/>As you say Anton, lots of comments, which also goes to prove the value of  a title to an image, not only does it add value to the image but it also gives an insight into the photographer''s thoughts and aims in creating the image which again helps the commenter to assess the image. Anyway, all that said, there is a surprisingly sharp DOF for such a large aperture, it works, the suns light and rays adds a nice touch of drama to the scene.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge brief well As you say Anton, lots of comments, which also goes to prove the value of  a title to an image, not only does it add value to the image but it also gives an insight into the photographer''s thoughts and aims in creating the image which again helps the commenter to assess the image. Anyway, all that said, there is a surprisingly sharp DOF for such a large aperture, it works, the suns light and rays adds a nice touch of drama to the scene.', '2018-02-02 09:41:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7557047, 1210737, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge brief well<br/> <br/>Great dynamics Drake, lots of comments, which also goes to prove the value of a title to an image, not only does it add value to the image but it also gives an insight into the photographer''s thoughts and aims in creating the image which again helps the commenter to assess the image. Anyway, all that said, the snow shower fills the frame nicely which would overpower the hard to see bird, its very fortunate the bird is such a bright scarlet colour it still manages to come through.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge brief well Great dynamics Drake, lots of comments, which also goes to prove the value of a title to an image, not only does it add value to the image but it also gives an insight into the photographer''s thoughts and aims in creating the image which again helps the commenter to assess the image. Anyway, all that said, the snow shower fills the frame nicely which would overpower the hard to see bird, its very fortunate the bird is such a bright scarlet colour it still manages to come through.', '2018-02-02 09:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
